---
title: "Agitprop 1949 · The Kalashnikov Century — Theme Thunder"
---
{%- set art = collections.articles | articleBySlug("kalashnikov-century") -%}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ title }} — {{ site.name }}</title>
<meta name="description" content="{{ art.data.dek }}">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="{{ site.name }}">
<meta property="og:title" content="{{ art.data.title }} — Theme Thunder edition">
<meta property="og:description" content="Theme Thunder: the Kalashnikov story set as a Soviet constructivist poster — red wedges, worker's cream and heavy type.">
<meta property="og:type" content="article">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 16 16'%3E%3Crect width='16' height='16' fill='%23efe3cb'/%3E%3Cpath d='M0 16L16 0v6L6 16z' fill='%23c02418'/%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=PT+Sans:wght@400;700&family=PT+Serif:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
/* ============================================================
   THEME THUNDER № 5 — "AGITPROP 1949"
   A constructivist production poster: red wedge, worker's
   cream, heavy condensed capitals, one hundred million units.
   ============================================================ */
:root {
  --cream: #efe3cb;
  --cream-2:#e5d6b6;
  --red:   #c02418;
  --red-2: #99190f;
  --black: #211d18;
  --measure: 41rem;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  margin: 0; background: var(--cream); color: var(--black);
  font-family: "PT Serif", Georgia, serif; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.66;
}
a { color: var(--red); }
a:hover { background: var(--red); color: var(--cream); text-decoration: none; }
::selection { background: var(--red); color: var(--cream); }
.bebas { font-family: "Bebas Neue", "Oswald", sans-serif; font-weight: 400; }

/* --- top strip --------------------------------------------- */
.strip {
  background: var(--black); color: var(--cream);
  font-family: "PT Sans", sans-serif; font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase;
}
.strip-in { max-width: 60rem; margin-inline: auto; padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.3rem 1.6rem; justify-content: space-between; }
.strip a { color: var(--cream); text-decoration: none; }
.strip a:hover { background: var(--cream); color: var(--black); }

/* --- poster head ------------------------------------------- */
.plakat { background: var(--cream); border-bottom: 8px solid var(--black); }
.plakat-in { max-width: 60rem; margin-inline: auto; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
.plakat-bar {
  position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  background: var(--red); color: var(--cream);
  padding: 2.4rem 1.25rem 1.8rem;
}
.plakat-bar::after {
  content: ""; position: absolute; right: -5rem; top: -5rem;
  width: 13rem; height: 13rem; background: var(--black);
  transform: rotate(45deg);
}
.plakat-main { padding: 2.6rem 1.25rem 2.8rem; }
.zvezda { color: var(--cream); font-size: 2.2rem; line-height: 1; margin: 0 0 0.4rem; }
.gornyak {
  font-family: "PT Sans", sans-serif; font-weight: 700; color: var(--cream);
  letter-spacing: 0.34em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.85rem; margin: 0;
}
.gornyak .tr { display: block; color: rgba(239, 227, 203, 0.8); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.22em; font-size: 0.72rem; margin-top: 0.25rem; }
h1.zag {
  font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-transform: uppercase;
  font-size: clamp(3.4rem, 12vw, 8rem); line-height: 0.88; margin: 0 0 1.2rem; color: var(--black);
}
h1.zag em { font-style: normal; color: var(--red); display: block; }
.mil-number {
  font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif; color: var(--red);
  font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.4rem); line-height: 1; margin: 0 0 0.3rem; letter-spacing: 0.04em;
}
.mil-label { font-family: "PT Sans", sans-serif; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.26em; font-size: 0.8rem; margin: 0 0 1.8rem; color: var(--black); }
.dek-poster { max-width: 42rem; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 1.6rem; font-style: italic; color: #4a4234; }
.byrow { font-family: "PT Sans", sans-serif; font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.3rem 2.2rem; margin: 0; color: var(--black); }

/* --- article ----------------------------------------------- */
.tekst { max-width: var(--measure); margin: 3rem auto 0; padding-inline: 1.25rem; counter-reset: glava; }
.tekst > p { margin: 0 0 1.15em; }
.tekst > p:first-of-type::first-letter {
  font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif; float: left; font-size: 4em; line-height: 0.82;
  padding: 0.02em 0.14em 0 0; color: var(--red);
}
.tekst h2 {
  font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-transform: uppercase;
  font-size: 2rem; line-height: 1; margin: 2.3em 0 0.7em; counter-increment: glava;
  display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 0.7rem;
}
.tekst h2::before {
  content: counter(glava, decimal-leading-zero);
  background: var(--red); color: var(--cream); font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1;
  padding: 0.32em 0.42em 0.18em; flex: none; transform: translateY(-0.18em);
}
.tekst em { font-style: italic; }
.tekst .dinkus { text-align: center; color: var(--red); letter-spacing: 1.4em; padding-left: 1.4em; margin: 2em 0; }
/* factbox → the ledger, black panel */
.tekst .factbox { background: var(--black); color: var(--cream); margin: 2.2em 0; border-left: 10px solid var(--red); }
.tekst .factbox-title {
  margin: 0; padding: 0.75rem 1.2rem 0.6rem; font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif;
  font-weight: 400; font-size: 1.5rem; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase;
  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--red);
}
.tekst .factbox dl { margin: 0; padding: 0.5rem 1.2rem 0.7rem; }
.tekst .factbox .row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1.6rem; padding: 0.48rem 0; border-bottom: 1px dotted rgba(239, 227, 203, 0.35); }
.tekst .factbox .row:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
.tekst .factbox dt { font-family: "PT Sans", sans-serif; font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #cbbfa4; padding-top: 0.25em; }
.tekst .factbox dd { margin: 0; text-align: right; font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif; font-size: 1.15rem; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: var(--cream); }
/* pullquote → slogan */
.tekst .pullquote { margin: 2.6em -0.5rem; transform: rotate(-1.6deg); background: var(--red); color: var(--cream); padding: 1.4rem 1.6rem 1.2rem; box-shadow: 0.6rem 0.6rem 0 var(--black); }
.tekst .pullquote p { margin: 0; font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif; font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.1rem); line-height: 1.04; text-transform: uppercase; }
.tekst .pullquote cite { display: block; margin-top: 0.8rem; font-style: normal; font-family: "PT Sans", sans-serif; font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(239, 227, 203, 0.8); }
.tekst .pullquote cite::before { content: "— "; }

/* --- timeline → year column -------------------------------- */
.gody { max-width: var(--measure); margin: 3.4rem auto 0; padding-inline: 1.25rem; }
.gody-head { font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 2.4rem; line-height: 1; margin: 0 0 0.2rem; }
.gody-head em { font-style: normal; color: var(--red); }
.gody-sub { font-family: "PT Sans", sans-serif; font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6f6249; margin: 0 0 1.6rem; }
.gody ol { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; border-left: 6px solid var(--red); }
.gody li { position: relative; padding: 0 0 1.4rem 1.6rem; }
.gody li::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: -0.95rem; top: 0.42em; width: 1rem; height: 1rem; background: var(--cream); border: 4px solid var(--red); }
.gody li.key::before { background: var(--red); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--cream), 0 0 0 6px var(--black); }
.gody .d { font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif; font-size: 1.45rem; line-height: 1; color: var(--red); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
.gody h3 { margin: 0; font-family: "PT Sans", sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
.gody p { margin: 0.3rem 0 0; font-size: 0.97rem; color: #4a4234; }

/* --- sources + footer -------------------------------------- */
.istochniki { max-width: var(--measure); margin: 3rem auto 0; padding-inline: 1.25rem; font-size: 0.92rem; }
.istochniki h2 { font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 1.7rem; text-transform: uppercase; border-bottom: 4px solid var(--black); padding-bottom: 0.2rem; margin: 0 0 0.8rem; }
.istochniki ol { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.5rem; }
.istochniki li { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
.podval { margin-top: 3.5rem; background: var(--black); color: var(--cream); padding: 2.4rem 1.25rem 2.8rem; }
.podval-in { max-width: 60rem; margin-inline: auto; }
.podval .slogan { font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif; font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4.5vw, 2.6rem); line-height: 0.95; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }
.podval .slogan em { font-style: normal; color: var(--red); }
.podval .note { font-family: "PT Sans", sans-serif; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #b9ac8f; margin: 0 0 1.6rem; max-width: 46rem; }
.podval ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.6rem 2.4rem; font-family: "PT Sans", sans-serif; font-size: 0.82rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; }
.podval a { color: var(--cream); }
.podval a:hover { background: var(--red); color: var(--cream); }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="strip">
  <div class="strip-in">
    <span>{{ site.name }} // Theme Thunder № 5</span>
    <span lang="ru" title="State publishing pastiche">ГОСИЗДАТ · ПЛАКАТ № 47</span>
    <a href="{{ art.url }}">Standard edition →</a>
  </div>
</div>

<header class="plakat">
  <div class="plakat-bar">
    <div class="plakat-in">
      <p class="zvezda" aria-hidden="true">★</p>
      <p class="gornyak">Оружие века<span class="tr">"The weapon of the century" · a poster edition</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="plakat-main">
    <div class="plakat-in">
      <h1 class="zag">The Kalashnikov<em>Century</em></h1>
      <p class="mil-number">100 000 000</p>
      <p class="mil-label">Rifles, all patterns, estimated — the most manufactured firearm in history</p>
      <p class="dek-poster">{{ art.data.dek }}</p>
      <p class="byrow">
        <span>{{ art.data.byline }}</span>
        <span>{{ art.data.fileNo }}</span>
        <span>Posted {{ art.date | readableDate }}</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<article class="tekst" aria-label="Article, poster edition">
{{ art.templateContent | safe }}
</article>

{%- if art.data.timeline %}
<section class="gody" aria-label="Timeline">
  <h2 class="gody-head">One rifle's <em>century</em></h2>
  <p class="gody-sub">1941 — 2013 · from hospital sketchbook to a hundred million</p>
  <ol>
    {%- for item in art.data.timeline.items %}
    <li{% if item.key %} class="key"{% endif %}>
      <span class="d">{{ item.date }}</span>
      <h3>{{ item.title }}</h3>
      <p>{{ item.text }}</p>
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>
{%- endif %}

{%- if art.data.sources %}
<section class="istochniki" aria-label="Sources">
  <h2>Sources &amp; further reading</h2>
  <ol>
    {%- for s in art.data.sources %}
    <li>{{ s | safe }}</li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>
{%- endif %}

<footer class="podval">
  <div class="podval-in">
    <p class="slogan">The design will be obsolete eventually. <em>The rifles will not.</em></p>
    <p class="note">A Theme Thunder edition — the standard {{ site.name }} article, unaltered, re-set in the visual language of the state that shipped the rifle. The aesthetic is the artefact; the article is the argument.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="{{ art.url }}">Standard edition</a></li>
      <li><a href="/thunder/">Theme Thunder index</a></li>
      <li><a href="/">{{ site.name }} front page</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
